          <li>Anthropic: <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Building effective agents</a>、<a href="https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Effective context engineering for AI agents</a>、<a href="https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/demystifying-evals-for-ai-agents" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Demystifying evals for AI agents</a>。</li>
